# cs-triage-mail

Execute ALL steps below silently. **Do not address the operator until the
final report (step 6).** This is the genuinely-agentic capability of the
{{ company_prog_name }} operator: arbitrary inbound mail, real judgment, answered **in
{{ email_address }}'s voice through the engine**.

"Silently" means tool calls are fine, narration is not. The next
user-visible text is the report in step 6.

All commands run from the repo root with `.venv/bin/python -m cs …`.

